GIVEN `the certificate is tendered under subsection (9)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the party intending to produce it has, before the trial, given the accused reasonable notice of the intention together with a copy of the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
